    {
      "id": "1022287",
      "title": "",
      "description": "Temporary schedule adjustments:\r\n\u2022 Four off-peak inbound trains are temporarily removed from the schedule, with service operating roughly every two hours between 9am and 4pm: Trains 530 (9:05am), 538 (11:00am), 546 (1:05pm), and 554 (3:00pm)\r\n\u2022 Four off-peak outbound trains are temporarily removed from the schedule between 7:30am and 1:00pm, with service operating roughly every two hours: Trains 519 (7:30am), 525 (8:55am), 533 (10:50am), and 541 (12:55pm)\r\n\u2022 Several midday trips in both directions have 5 minutes added to their scheduled run times.\r\nInbound and outbound rush hour service is not affected.\r\n\r\nCrews will replace 80,000 linear feet, or 15 miles, of rail between Framingham and Auburndale. This is the equivalent of 7.5 track miles when accounting for both tracks. The new rail will not need to be replaced again for 25+ years.",
      "severity": 8,
      "route_id": "unknown"
    },
