      "title": "",
      "description": "The elevator is closed for major equipment upgrades that will significantly improve the long-term reliability of this elevator.\r\n \r\nTo exit: Travel down the Summer St concourse towards the Red Line. About halfway down the concourse, take a left through the set of glass doors marked 101 Arch St. Follow signs to the elevator. Take elevator to the 101 Arch St lobby and exit on Summer St.\r\n \r\nTo board: Proceed to 101 Arch St on Summer St (across from Macy\u2019s).  Take elevator located in the rear-left corner of the lobby to Summer St concourse.  At the concourse, turn right and follow signs to Oak Grove platform. \r\n",
